---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import wallpapers from '../data/wallpapers.json';
---

<Layout title="Photo credits" pageTitle="Photo credits" kind="page">
  <article class="page-content credits-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Behind the desktop</p>
    <h1>Photo credits</h1>
    <p class="lead">Real places. Real photographs. A few things I like, brought together on a quiet desktop.</p>
    <p>These wallpapers are licensed photographs, with credit to their original photographers below. The images were resized and encoded as WebP; the mobile versions are cropped for portrait screens. The site adds grayscale, darkening, responsive cropping, and optional gentle pan, zoom, and crossfade motion.</p>
    <p>Each adapted photograph is offered under the same Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike license as its source. No generative editing or compositing was used. Motion comes from still photographs, not video footage.</p>

    <div class="entry-list credits-list">
      {wallpapers.map((wallpaper) => (
        <section class="entry" id={wallpaper.id} aria-labelledby={`credit-${wallpaper.id}`}>
          <img src={wallpaper.src} alt={wallpaper.title} width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="credit-details"><p class="eyebrow">Photography · {wallpaper.license}</p>
          <h2 id={`credit-${wallpaper.id}`}>{wallpaper.title}</h2>
          <p>{wallpaper.credit}</p>
          <p>
            <a class="text-link" href={wallpaper.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original photograph and source</a>
            {' · '}
            <a class="text-link" href={wallpaper.licenseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{wallpaper.license} license</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="text-link" href={wallpaper.src} download>Download desktop adaptation</a>
            {' · '}
            <a class="text-link" href={wallpaper.mobileSrc} download>Download mobile adaptation</a>
          </p>
        </div></section>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p>Photographers, licensors, brands, teams, venues, and other rights holders do not sponsor or endorse this site. The photo licenses do not grant trademark, privacy, or publicity rights. The Eau Rouge image was taken during the 2013 Belgian Grand Prix weekend; it does not depict the current season.</p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/">Back home</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
